reaming:** Enjoy crisp, low-latency gameplay at 1080p (and HDR 4K on supported PS5 connections) with buttery-smooth 60fps frame rates.\n* **Immersive Virtual Displays:** Resize, reposition, and curve your screen anywhere in your physical space using Meta Quest's seamless window management.\n* **Native Controller Support:** Connect your DualSense or DualShock 4 controller directly to your headset via Bluetooth for precise, zero-compromise input.\n* **Open Source:** Fully transparent, ad-free, and community-driven. Horizon Stream complies with the AGPLv3 license and is built upon the renowned `chiaki-ng` project.\n\n*Disclaimer: This application is a third-party, open-source client. It is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or associated with Sony Interactive Entertainment. \"PlayStation\", \"PS5\", and \"PS4\" are registered trademarks of Sony Interactive Entertainment Inc.*", "short_description": "Experience your favorite PlayStation 4 and PlayStation 5 games on massive virtual screens in your Meta Quest headset with low-latency remote play."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://github.com/0TheRain0/horizonstream/blob/main/meta_store_assets/privacy_policy.md", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "CMSoft", "support_website_url": "https://github.com/0TheRain0/horizonstream", "website_url": "https://github.com/0TheRain0/horizonstream", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "393222478507326"}, {"id": "1055187466124150"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "ST